    "PDF page rendered at 300 dpi with pdftoppm, each panel cropped and enlarged 2x (1340 px per 1.2 Mach in part (a), 1502 px per 2.8 Mach in part (b)); values read by eye against the printed grid (0.1 in C_D,N; 0.2 in Mach in (a), 0.4 in (b)) by interpolating pixel positions; no overlay. Curve identity by line style matched to the legend symbols (solid = circle, dashed = square, dash-dot = diamond), the same rule as the top panel where the configuration leaders are unambiguous.",
    "PDF page rendered at 200 dpi (a different rendering from pass 1), each panel cropped and enlarged 3x with a 20 px pixel ruler overlaid; the reader transcribed the pixel coordinates (in 200 dpi page pixels) of the axis labels and gridlines, then of each curve at fixed Mach columns; the values below are computed by the merge script from the calibration, not read as values. Done after pass 1 without re-reading it."
  ],
